  "query_preview": "Forecast: Wednesday through the Weekend\n\nA welcome shift toward quieter, more seasonal weather arrives mid-\nweek. Beginning Wednesday, a sprawling Canadian high-pressure \nsystem will settle into the Midwest, ushering in a drier airmass\nand providing relief from the recent heat. Expect comfortable \ntemperatures topping out in the low to mid-80s, with a dry \nforecast prevailing through the remainder of the work week. As \nthe surface ridge axis drifts to our east next weekend, a \ngradual warming trend will commence, bringing a return of warmer\nsoutherly flow.",
